{"3915220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Love Too Easily 2: Summer Pocha", "steam_appid": 3915220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/3ec85bb506a72f590d0828ff64471314.poster.avif?t=1764745515\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/3ec85bb506a72f590d0828ff64471314.webm?t=1764745515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/3ec85bb506a72f590d0828ff64471314.mp4?t=1764745515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;That night… did we just clink our glasses?&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were living the life of an ordinary delivery man, and one day you get scammed by your only friend and end up taking over a failing, debt-ridden Pocha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait... but why are there so many pretty girls at this Pocha?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/7021195029c91d3b065e3c170ce10a4e.poster.avif?t=1764745515\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/7021195029c91d3b065e3c170ce10a4e.webm?t=1764745515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/7021195029c91d3b065e3c170ce10a4e.mp4?t=1764745515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story shaped entirely by your choices, '<strong>Love Too Easily 2: Summer Pocha</strong>' is an FMV simulation game where the story unfolds in a Pocha with five attractive girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the owner of a Pocha and win over the affection of the girls you like to find your true love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the right choices to raise affection levels, and show your feelings with thoughtful gifts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five girls, each with her own charm and personality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable Pocha part-timer: Choi Sol (Lee Heeru)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/c4bd1dfa90cef3373e9c20f596d42226.poster.avif?t=1764745515\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/c4bd1dfa90cef3373e9c20f596d42226.webm?t=1764745515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/c4bd1dfa90cef3373e9c20f596d42226.mp4?t=1764745515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overflowing with cuteness—the bright and bubbly mascot of the Pocha!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“Good morning, boss!”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pocha regular/writer: Anna (Shin Jiwon/Johyun)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/4ba43af96e57077583e2e79da7daad84.poster.avif?t=1764745515\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://